<title>UK: TABLE-Inspirations H1 loss narrows.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Inspirations H1 loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31</p>
<p>(million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		24.6 loss	    vs 26.4 loss</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 nil		    vs n/a</p>
<p> Pretax		     11.7 loss	    vs 13.3 loss</p>
<p> Turnover		   125.9		  vs 132.1</p>
<p>NOTE - The pre-tax figure includes a 1.6 million stg ex-gratia payment from British Airways Plc following aircraft maintenance schedule problems last year.</p>
<p>The company said there was heavy last minute discounting on its package holidays in May and June but margins for July onwards had been largely restored, thanks to a combination of building society windfalls and wet weather in the UK.</p>
<p>Full company name -- Inspirations Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
